"help_お試し_title" = "Monthly free uses";
"help_お試し_body" = "Without your own API key, the FREE plan gets 30 bus checks per month using the shared key. PREMIUM plan gets 60 per month. Resets on the 1st. Remaining uses appear in the toolbar center. Setting your own API key (PREMIUM) gives unlimited checks.";
"help_経路_title" = "Transit routes";
"help_経路_body" = "Tap the routes button on the main screen (or shake the device) to browse transit options to your destination. Tap a route to view it on the map, or long-press a bus number badge to start riding mode right away.";
"help_乗車中_title" = "Riding mode";
"help_乗車中_body" = "After a green or yellow \"Get on!\" result, tap Start riding (or long-press a bus number in the route list) to enter riding mode. It tracks the straight-line distance to your current bus's alighting stop and notifies you with your configured alerts. When transferring, the distance switches to the next alighting stop. Tap the \"Riding\" indicator at the top-left to open the route map. Use the Get off button on the card to end riding.";
"help_設定_title" = "Settings & alerts";
"help_設定_body" = "From … → Settings you can change language, color theme, appearance (card frame & texture), keypad sound, and arrival alerts. Arrival alerts are distance-based to the alighting stop, with up to 3 thresholds — alarms play 1–3 times from furthest to closest. Alarms and alerts work even when the app is in the background or the screen is off. Maps and Routes API keys are also configured here (PREMIUM).";

