"プライバシー_Google詳細" = "Google LLC (Routes API, Maps SDK, and Geocoding) receives your current or selected origin, destination, map viewport, and API key to calculate routes, display maps, and identify addresses. Bus numbers are matched against Google Routes results on-device and are not added to Google's route request body. Google's terms and privacy policy apply.";
"プライバシー_Apple詳細" = "Apple Inc. (MapKit search and geocoding) receives search terms, selected coordinates, and nearby context needed for the request to find places and display addresses. Apple's terms and privacy policy apply.";
"プライバシー_Overpass詳細" = "OpenStreetMap Overpass API operators (overpass-api.de, Kumi Systems, and Mail.ru endpoints) receive the bus number, current or origin coordinates, search radius, and selected route ID to retrieve route candidates, geometry, and stops. The app may retry operators in sequence. Each operator's logging and retention policy applies.";
"プライバシー_端末保存" = "Storage on your device";
"プライバシー_保存詳細" = "Destination, saved places, display settings, and consent are stored in UserDefaults. Destination history and your Google API key are stored in Keychain. Route results remain in memory during use and are not kept as a persistent route history after the app exits.";
"プライバシー_保持削除詳細" = "Stored data is retained until you delete it or clear the app's storage. Keychain items may remain after app deletion, so use Delete All Data here. External providers retain and delete data under their own policies; this app cannot delete provider-side records.";
"プライバシー_StoreKit詳細" = "Apple StoreKit is used to load product information, purchase or restore the plan, and verify entitlements. Apple processes transactions; the app does not receive or store payment-card details. The current plan state is stored on-device. Apple purchase history cannot be deleted here.";
